    "updated_at": "2018-05-22T08:50:18Z",
    "body": "Here's the problem:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nfetch('https://example.com/whatever', { mode: 'no-cors' }).catch(() => {\r\n  // This smells like a CORB-blocked resource.\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe question is, is this an acceptable data leak?",
